            "description": "This table holds harmonised sector codes and names of the sectors used in greenhouse gas emission projections submitted under EU legislation. They follow the so called \"Common Reporting Format\" (CRF) according to the IPCC 2006 Guidelines. The harmonisation was required as sector names across different submission years varied. Thus,  data comparisons across sectors and different submission years were not possible straight-fowardly with the original data.",
